# Test and Audit Folder

This folder defines how we verify that changes are correct.

## test-strategy.md
What types of tests are required.

## validation.md
Acceptance criteria and validation rules.

## audit-checklist.md
Things that must be checked before completing a change.

## known-issues.md
Known bugs, limitations and technical debt.

Tests themselves remain in the project's actual test directories.
These Markdown files describe the validation approach.
